<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Slot Completed</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:20px 0;">

<table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff">

<!-- Header -->
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#3a3a3a; padding:15px 30px;">
  <img src="https://static.anylicence.com/media/statics/logo.png" style="width:140px;" />
</td>
</tr>

<!-- Body -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:25px 30px; color:#333; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">

<p><strong>Hi {{receiverName}},</strong></p>

<p>
The following session has been successfully <strong>completed</strong>.
</p>

<p><strong>📅 Date:</strong> {{slotDate}}</p>
<p><strong>⏰ Time:</strong> {{startTime}} - {{endTime}}</p>
<p><strong>📘 Type:</strong> {{type}}</p>

{{#if hours}}
<p><strong>⏳ Duration:</strong> {{hours}} hours</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if instructorEarning}}
<p><strong>💰 Earnings:</strong> ${{instructorEarning}}</p>
{{/if}}

<p>
Thank you for using AnyLicence. Keep learning and driving safely 🚗
</p>

<p style="margin-top:20px;">
<strong>Team AnyLicence</strong><br/>
<a href="{{website_url}}" style="color:#ff9800;">{{website_url}}</a>
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="background-color:#ffb300; height:5px;"></td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>